### 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health

### 智能配方推荐
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenario": "parking",
  "strength_requirement": "high",
  "permeability_requirement": "high",
  "construction_mode": "precast",
  "cost_priority": "balanced"
}

### 半经验性能评估
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "aggregate_grade": "MP",
  "forming_method": "VM",
  "porosity_pct": 25.0,
  "water_binder_ratio": 0.16,
  "aggregate_binder_ratio": 4.8,
  "age_day": 28,
  "scenario": "parking"
}

### 节能减排测算
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/carbon-economy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area_m2": 1000,
  "thickness_cm": 10,
  "steel_slag_consumption_kg_m3": 1700,
  "raw_material_cost_saving_pct": 30,
  "construction_maintenance_saving_pct": 40
}

### 项目问答
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/qa
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "为什么 25% 孔隙率重要？",
  "use_llm": true
}
